---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <main>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="header-inner">
        <a href="/" class="brand">FINICKY BEE</a>

        <nav>
  <a href="/finds">Finicky Bee Finds</a>
  <a href="/collection">Collection</a>
  <a href="/research">Research</a>
  <a href="/about">About</a>
  <a href="/shop">Shop</a>
</nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT FINICKY BEE</p>

        <h1>Preserving Moments in Time — One Collectible at a Time.</h1>

        <p class="hero-text">
          Finicky Bee is an independent collecting, research, documentation,
          and storytelling project focused on vintage and antique collectibles.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">THE FINICKY BEE STORY</p>

    <h2>Discovering, collecting, and preserving objects with stories to tell.</h2>

    <p>
      Finicky Bee is dedicated to discovering, collecting, researching, and
      preserving vintage, antique, nostalgic, and collectible treasures.
    </p>

    <p>
      We carefully select objects for their craftsmanship, history, character,
      curiosity, or the connection they can inspire.
    </p>

    <p>
      Some collectibles make us smile the moment we discover them. Others make
      us stop and wonder who made them, how they were used, and what stories
      they may have carried through time.
    </p>

    <p>
      Whether a piece brings back a cherished memory, sparks curiosity, or
      simply catches the eye, we believe objects from the past can continue
      to have meaning long after their original moment has passed.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section about-values">
  <div class="narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">WHAT MATTERS</p>

    <h2>Respect for the objects and the people behind them.</h2>

    <p>
      We have deep respect for the artists, makers, manufacturers,
      craftspeople, collectors, and caretakers whose creativity, skill, and
      dedication allow remarkable objects to survive through time.
    </p>

    <p>
      We believe collectibles deserve to be appreciated, cared for, researched,
      documented, and preserved.
    </p>

    <div class="value-list">
      <article>
        <h3>Historical Preservation</h3>
        <p>
          Keeping meaningful objects and their stories connected through
          careful documentation.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3>Research</h3>
        <p>
          Studying physical evidence, makers, materials, marks, and documented
          sources.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3>Authenticity</h3>
        <p>
          Separating what can be supported by evidence from what remains
          uncertain.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3>Transparency</h3>
        <p>
          Presenting research honestly without manufacturing certainty where
          evidence is incomplete.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section mission">
  <div class="narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">FROM DISCOVERY TO PRESERVATION</p>

    <h2>Every discovery begins with curiosity.</h2>

    <p>
      Through careful observation, research, photography, and documentation,
      Finicky Bee works to understand what an object can tell us.
    </p>

    <p>
      The process also means recognizing what the available evidence cannot
      establish. When information is uncertain, that uncertainty becomes part
      of the record rather than something to be filled with assumptions.
    </p>

    <p>
      Collectibles may be offered for sale through selected marketplaces.
      Those purchases help sustain the time, research, documentation,
      photography, preservation, and storytelling that make the Finicky Bee
      mission possible.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section founder">
  <div class="narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">THE FOUNDER</p>

    <h2>A collector, researcher, and entrepreneur preserving stories through objects.</h2>

    <p>
      Finicky Bee was created as an independent collecting and research
      project with a simple belief: ordinary-looking objects can carry
      extraordinary stories.
    </p>

    <p>
      The work brings together collecting, research, documentation,
      entrepreneurship, and storytelling while keeping authenticity,
      transparency, and responsible research at the center.
    </p>

    <a
      href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/daisybox/"
      class="text-link"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      View the Founder’s Professional Profile →
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div>
        <p class="footer-brand">FINICKY BEE</p>
        <p>Preserving Moments in Time — One Collectible at a Time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/about">About</a>
        <a href="/#research">Research</a>
        <a href="/#collection">Collection</a>
        <a href="/#finds">Finicky Bee Finds</a>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
      </div>

      <p class="copyright">
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} Finicky Bee. All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    background: #f7f3ea;
    color: #2f302c;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  }

  .site-header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd6c8;
    background: #f7f3ea;
  }

  .header-inner {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .brand,
  nav a,
  .footer-links a {
    color: #2f4f3f;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .brand {
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 22px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  nav a,
  .footer-links a {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .page-hero {
    padding: 110px 24px 90px;
    background: #2f4f3f;
    color: #f7f3ea;
  }

  .section {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 90px 24px;
  }

  .narrow {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: #d4a437;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  h3 {
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    color: #2f4f3f;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem);
  }

  h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    color: #2f4f3f;
    font-size: 1.45rem;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .hero-text {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .value-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 36px;
    margin-top: 45px;
  }

  .value-list article {
    border-top: 1px solid #d4a437;
    padding-top: 20px;
  }

  .mission {
    background: #ece7da;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .mission .narrow,
  .founder .narrow {
    max-width: 780px;
  }

  .founder {
    padding-bottom: 110px;
  }

  .text-link {
    color: #2f4f3f;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .text-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .site-footer {
    background: #2f4f3f;
    color: #f7f3ea;
    padding: 55px 24px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .site-footer p {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    color: #d4a437;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px 22px;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    color: #f7f3ea;
  }

  .copyright {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    padding-top: 25px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(247, 243, 234, 0.2);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .header-inner {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    nav {
      gap: 12px 18px;
    }

    .page-hero {
      padding: 80px 24px 70px;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 65px 24px;
    }

    .value-list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .site-footer {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .copyright {
      grid-column: auto;
    }
  }
</style>